WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.480
Choose data collection tools to suit the question: surveys, observations, experiments

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.920
or reliable records.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:12.538
Choose the data collection method for favourite school subject. The answer is

00:00:12.538 --> 00:00:16.103
questionnaire. The most direct reliable method here is questionnaire.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.066
A class in a craft workshop wants to find the number of cars passing a gate. Which

00:00:22.066 --> 00:00:25.377
data collection method should they use? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:31.930
A class in a craft workshop wants to find the number of cars passing a gate. Which

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:36.312
data collection method should they use? The answer is observation. The most direct

00:00:36.312 --> 00:00:37.997
reliable method here is observation.
